            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc Tho",
            "review_text": "Nam tran\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nSatisfied\nSep 2019 • Friends\nOne of the best restaurant in town with the mixtures between traditional Vietnamese cuisines and Western foods. Togother with the great foods, the service here is also excellent, especially from the lady owner. \n\nMoreover, it is located next to Sai Gon river which brings fresh and peaceful environment to whom want to have a great evening with friends.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 6, 2019",
