            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc Tho",
            "review_text": "World_Xplorer_v1\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam147 contributions\n0\nGreat Vietnamese fusion\nDec 2018 • Friends\nA very surprising find on the other side of the Saigon river: modern, clean and open space and a great variety of Vietnamese/Western fusion cuisine. Coupled with some western draft beers, it makes for a wonderful evening. How does this place stand out among others? It’s clean, great service and affordable price that go hand in hand with tasty tasty food!\nAbsolutely going back there!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 31, 2018",
