            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc Tho",
            "review_text": "Olga K\n1 contribution\n0\nAmazing place and fabulous food! Immediately go there!\nSep 2018 • Friends\nI was very surprised that in busy city like Saigon I found such a peaceful place with a family atmosphere and a very welcoming owner.\nWhat I would advise? Their beef and pork. The piglet was amazing, fresh and still not heavy. Craft beer of European taste. \nThey have very tasty German sausages with mustard. I was very amused with their buns given to the meet. It is just a glorious food.\nI had my good bye party there with the friends and colleagues. It was a memorable event thanks to the people.\nAgain, very very recommended from a foreigner point of view. And if you are European, go there immediately after arrival to Vietnam! he hosts will tell you many interesting stories and advise you of how to feel happy in this city!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 9, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
