            "review_text": "Linh Ly\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam27 contributions\n0\nPerfect restaurant with very delicious food\nDec 2018 • Friends\nIt’s a very nice restaurant with beautiful, opened and peaceful view. Perfect food, they have Western food and Vietnamese food so everyone can choose their own favorite! I highly recomendes this place. Besides, they have draft beer- Belgium beer and German beer as well as Vietnam beer, so you have multiple choices if you are a beer drinker. For the one who like wine, they serve wine in the restaurant too. Vietnam, Spain wine...\nRead more\nWritten December 7, 2018",
